===Etymology===
From {{bor|de|gml|motte}}, {{m|gml|mutte}}, from {{der|de|osx|*motta}}, {{m|osx|*motto}}, from {{der|de|gmw-pro|*mottō}}, {{m|gmw-pro|*moþþō}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|mot}} and {{cog|en|moth}}, which see for more.

